cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PSG-JEPA-1D
message: >-
  Parallel implementation of PSG-JEPA on an exactly-solvable 1-D car world.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A 1-D longitudinal-control world whose optimal solution is exactly computable, used to measure
  physical state grounding for JEPA world models against an absolute reference rather than
  relative planning success. Derived from PSG-JEPA (Yan et al., arXiv:2608.06799).
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Is Forward Prediction Enough? Physical State Grounding for JEPA World Models"
    authors:
      - family-names: Yan
        given-names: Haodong
    year: 2026
    identifiers:
      - type: other
        value: arXiv:2608.06799
